          <div class="role__chapter">
            <h4>Web Platform, Accessibility &amp; Standards <span>2025–Present</span></h4>
            <ul>
              <li>
                Revived the <a href="https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/11723"><code>focusgroup</code>
